---
import LegalLayout from "../layouts/LegalLayout.astro";
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — DocsBuddy"
  description="How DocsBuddy collects, uses, stores and protects your personal information."
  heading="Privacy Policy"
  updated="Last updated: 21 June 2026"
>
  <p>
    This Privacy Policy explains how <strong>DocsBuddy</strong> ("we", "us", the "app") collects,
    uses, stores and protects your information when you use our mobile application and website at <a
      href="https://docsbuddy.mytechbytes.in">docsbuddy.mytechbytes.in</a
    >. By using DocsBuddy you agree to the practices described here.
  </p>

  <div class="note">
    DocsBuddy is a personal asset and reminder tracker. We collect only what is needed to run the
    service, never sell your data, and never use your documents for advertising.
  </div>

  <h2>1. Information we collect</h2>
  <p>We collect the following categories of information:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Account information</strong> — your name and email address, used to create and secure your
      account.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Asset &amp; reminder data</strong> — the assets you add (vehicles, appliances, electronics,
      etc.), their details, and the due dates you track (insurance, AMC, pollution, warranty, registration,
      fitness, tax).
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Documents you upload</strong> — invoices, warranty cards, insurance policies, photos and
      similar files you choose to attach to an asset.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Family / sharing data</strong> — the family group you create or join and the members you
      invite.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Device &amp; push tokens</strong> — a push-notification token and basic device/platform
      information so we can deliver reminders.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Usage &amp; diagnostic data</strong> — limited technical logs (e.g. crashes, errors) used
      to keep the app reliable.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>2. How we use your information</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      To provide the core service — storing your assets, documents and reminders, and syncing them
      across your devices and family members.
    </li>
    <li>
      To send you renewal reminders and notifications via push, email or WhatsApp according to your
      settings.
    </li>
    <li>To authenticate you and keep your account and data secure.</li>
    <li>To diagnose problems, improve performance and develop new features.</li>
    <li>To respond to your support requests.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>3. Service providers we use</h2>
  <p>We rely on trusted third-party platforms to operate DocsBuddy. Your data may be processed by:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Supabase</strong> — authentication, database and file storage for your account, asset data
      and documents.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Firebase Cloud Messaging (Google)</strong> — delivery of push notifications and reminders
      to your device.
    </li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    These providers process data on our behalf under their own security and privacy commitments. We
    share only what is necessary for them to perform these functions.
  </p>

  <h2>4. Legal basis &amp; consent</h2>
  <p>
    We process your information to perform our contract with you (providing the app), with your
    consent (e.g. notification channels and document uploads), and to pursue our legitimate interest
    in keeping the service secure and reliable. You can withdraw consent at any time by changing your
    settings or deleting your account.
  </p>

  <h2>5. Data sharing</h2>
  <p>
    We do <strong>not</strong> sell your personal information. We do not share it with advertisers. Data
    is shared only: (a) with the service providers listed above; (b) with the family members you choose
    to invite, who can view and update shared assets; and (c) where required by law or to protect our
    rights and users.
  </p>

  <h2>6. Data retention</h2>
  <p>
    We keep your information for as long as your account is active. When you delete an asset or
    document it is removed from active storage, and when you delete your account your personal data
    is deleted within a reasonable period, except where we must retain limited records to comply with
    legal obligations.
  </p>

  <h2>7. Security</h2>
  <p>
    Your data is transmitted over encrypted connections (HTTPS/TLS) and stored by our providers with
    access controls and row-level security so that only you and your family can read your records.
    Authentication tokens are stored in your device's secure keystore. No method of transmission or
    storage is perfectly secure, but we work to protect your information using industry-standard
    safeguards.
  </p>

  <h2>8. Your rights</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Access &amp; portability</strong> — request a copy of the data we hold about you.</li>
    <li><strong>Correction</strong> — update inaccurate information directly in the app.</li>
    <li><strong>Deletion</strong> — delete individual assets, documents, or your whole account.</li>
    <li>
      <strong>Withdraw consent</strong> — turn off notification channels or revoke document access at
      any time.
    </li>
  </ul>
  <p>To exercise any of these rights, contact us at the address below.</p>

  <h2>9. Children's privacy</h2>
  <p>
    DocsBuddy is not directed to children under 13 (or the minimum age in your jurisdiction). We do
    not knowingly collect personal information from children. If you believe a child has provided us
    data, contact us and we will delete it.
  </p>

  <h2>10. International transfers</h2>
  <p>
    Your information may be processed on servers located outside your country of residence. Where
    this happens, we rely on our providers' safeguards to protect your data in line with applicable
    law.
  </p>

  <h2>11. Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>
    We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Material changes will be reflected by the
    "Last updated" date above and, where appropriate, communicated in the app.
  </p>

  <h2>12. Contact us</h2>
  <p>
    Questions about this policy or your data? Email us at <a
      href="mailto:support@docsbuddy.mytechbytes.in">support@docsbuddy.mytechbytes.in</a
    >.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
